   "limit": "bench/l3/claude is the pure packet API (head_packet / tail_packet / window_packet of a0..a4_root.pruv, runner work/a4/rs_rust/runner reads \"op flag|bytes\" lines and prints packet words). It has no listing or read driver that returns import rows or an ExternalRecord, no project/home walk and no JSON result, so there is nothing to register as the entry engine result."
  }
